"template_prompt.phone_discussion_notes" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 电话沟通记录\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **通话日期**: [Date]\n- **参与人员**: [Name/Role]\n- **通话时长**: [Duration]\n- **主题**: [Topic]\n\n---\n\n## 背景\n\n[简要说明促成这通电话的原因以及发起沟通的缘由]\n\n---\n\n## 主要话题\n\n### 话题 1: [Topic name]\n\n- **讨论内容**: [Main content discussed for this topic]\n- **各方立场**: [Views or positions of each party]\n- **达成结论**: [Conclusion or decision on this topic]\n\n### 话题 2: [Topic name]\n\n- **讨论内容**: [Main content discussed for this topic]\n- **各方立场**: [Views or positions of each party]\n- **达成结论**: [Conclusion or decision on this topic]\n\n---\n\n## 关键结论\n\n| 事项 | 结论 | 理由 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| [Item] | [Conclusion] | [Rationale] |\n| [Item] | [Conclusion] | [Rationale] |\n\n---\n\n## 未决分歧\n\n[记录尚未达成一致或需进一步确认的问题；如无可省略]\n\n---\n\n## 后续行动\n\n| 行动项 | 负责人 | 截止日期 |\n|----------|--------|----------|\n| [Action item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n\n---\n\n## 补充说明\n\n[记录通话中提到的其他信息、参考资料或其他要点；如无可省略]";
"template_prompt.manager_employee_1_1_meeting" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 1:1 会议总结\n\n## 基本信息\n- **会议日期**: [Date]\n- **参与人员**: [Manager name] / [Employee name]\n- **会议时长**: [Duration]\n- **会议类型**: [Regular check-in / Development planning / Issue discussion / Other]\n\n---\n\n## 主要话题\n> 本次讨论聚焦的主要话题或目标\n\n- [Topic 1]\n- [Topic 2]\n- [Topic 3]\n\n---\n\n## 进展与状态\n> 员工当前的工作进展与目标完成情况\n\n- **进展顺利**: [Items where progress is currently good]\n- **阻碍因素**: [Difficulties or sticking points encountered]\n- **所需支持**: [Resources or assistance the employee would like]\n\n---\n\n## 关键反馈\n> 双方在会议中提出的关键反馈与看法\n\n**管理者反馈**\n- [Feedback point]\n\n**员工反馈**\n- [Feedback point]\n\n---\n\n## 成长与发展\n> 与职业发展、能力提升或个人目标相关的讨论\n\n- **发展方向**: [Employee's development goals or desired direction]\n- **重点领域**: [Capabilities or areas that need strengthening]\n- **支持计划**: [Development support or recommendations provided by the manager]\n\n---\n\n## 行动项\n> 会议中商定的具体待办事项，明确负责人与截止时间\n\n| 事项 | 负责人 | 截止日期 |\n|------|--------|----------|\n| [Action item 1] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item 2] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item 3] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n\n---\n\n## 后续跟进\n- **下次会议日期**: [Date]\n- **需重点回顾的事项**: [Content to prioritize reviewing at the next meeting]\n- **其他备注**: [Other information worth recording]";
"template_prompt.customer_call_summary_analysis" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 客户通话总结与分析\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **通话日期**: [Date]\n- **通话时长**: [Duration]\n- **客服人员**: [Name]\n- **客户编号/姓名**: [Customer information]\n- **通话类型**: [Inquiry / Complaint / After-sales / Follow-up / Other]\n\n---\n\n## 通话概览\n\n[用2–3句话简述本次通话的背景、起因和整体情况]\n\n---\n\n## 客户诉求\n\n### 主要问题\n[客户在本次通话中提出的核心问题或需求]\n\n### 情绪状态\n[客户整体情绪表现，如平静、焦虑、不满、激动等，并简要说明原因]\n\n---\n\n## 通话过程小结\n\n### 处理过程\n[按时间顺序概述关键沟通节点，总结客服人员如何回应客户诉求]\n\n### 最终结果\n[通话结束时的结果，如问题解决、已升级、待跟进等]\n\n---\n\n## 语气与沟通评估\n\n### 语气恰当性\n**评分**: [1–5]\n[评估客服人员用语是否礼貌专业、语气是否平稳，有无不当措辞或情绪化表达]\n\n### 共情能力\n**评分**: [1–5]\n[评估客服人员是否积极倾听、理解客户情绪、认可客户感受，并让客户感到被重视]\n\n### 节奏与把控\n**评分**: [1–5]\n[评估客服人员是否有效引导通话方向、在客户情绪激动时能否稳定局面、通话节奏是否合理]\n\n### 综合评分\n**综合评级**: [1–5]\n[对本次通话沟通表现的整体评估]\n\n---\n\n## 优点与改进空间\n\n### 优点\n- [Strength 1]\n- [Strength 2]\n\n### 改进空间\n- [Weakness 1]\n- [Weakness 2]\n\n---\n\n## 跟进事项\n\n| 跟进事项 | 负责人 | 预期完成 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| [Item] | [Name] | [Date] |\n\n---\n\n## 总结与建议\n\n[结合本次通话，为客服人员提供具体的改进建议或正向肯定，重点围绕沟通技巧与服务质量]";
"template_prompt.business_call" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 商务通话总结\n\n## 基本信息\n- **通话日期**: [Date]\n- **通话时长**: [Duration]\n- **参与人员**: [Own name/title] · [Other party's name/title/company]\n- **主题**: [Topic]\n\n## 通话概览\n[用2–3句话简述通话背景与主要目的]\n\n## 讨论要点\n### 1. [Point 1 title]\n[该话题的讨论内容与结论]\n\n### 2. [Point 2 title]\n[该话题的讨论内容与结论]\n\n### 3. [Point 3 title]\n[该话题的讨论内容与结论]\n\n## 关键共识\n- [Agreement or confirmed item reached by both parties]\n- [Agreement or confirmed item reached by both parties]\n\n## 待确认事项\n- [Unresolved issues or matters requiring further clarification]\n- [Unresolved issues or matters requiring further clarification]\n\n## 后续行动\n| 行动项 | 负责人 | 截止日期 |\n|--------|------|--------|\n| [Action item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n\n## 备注\n[其他值得记录的补充信息，如特别承诺或风险提示]";
"template_prompt.interview_notes" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 访谈记录总结\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **访谈主题**: [Topic]\n- **访谈日期**: [Date]\n- **访谈时长**: [Duration]\n- **形式**: [Online / In-person / Phone]\n- **访谈者**: [Name / Organization]\n- **受访者**: [Name]\n- **受访者背景**: [Brief description of role, field, or identity]\n\n---\n\n## 访谈概览\n\n[用不超过100字简述本次访谈的核心话题、整体基调与主要方向]\n\n---\n\n## 受访者核心观点\n\n> 提炼受访者表达的最核心、最具代表性的立场与判断\n\n1. [Core viewpoint 1]\n2. [Core viewpoint 2]\n3. [Core viewpoint 3]\n\n---\n\n## 关键问答摘要\n\n### 问题 1: [Question topic]\n- **问题**: [Question content]\n- **回答摘要**: [Core content of the interviewee's answer]\n\n### 问题 2: [Question topic]\n- **问题**: [Question content]\n- **回答摘要**: [Core content of the interviewee's answer]\n\n### 问题 3: [Question topic]\n- **问题**: [Question content]\n- **回答摘要**: [Core content of the interviewee's answer]\n\n---\n\n## 关键信息与数据\n\n- [Important data, events, cases, or citations mentioned by the interviewee]\n- [Key information 2]\n- [Key information 3]\n\n---\n\n## 分歧与争议点\n\n[记录访谈中出现的意见分歧、未决话题，或受访者回避、含糊其辞的问题；如无可写 \"无\"]\n\n---\n\n## 可深入探讨的线索\n\n- [Topics or people mentioned but not explored in depth]\n- [Information worth further verification or follow-up questioning]\n\n---\n\n## 后续跟进\n\n| 跟进事项 | 负责人 | 预期完成 |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| [Item 1] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Item 2] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n\n---\n\n## 总结与评估\n\n[Overall assessment of this interview: informational value, the interviewee's level of cooperation, topic coverage completeness, and its reference value for subsequent work]";
"template_prompt.panel_discussion" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# [Discussion Topic] 圆桌讨论总结\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **讨论主题**: [Topic]\n- **日期**: [Date]\n- **形式**: [Format, e.g., online webinar / in-person roundtable / public discussion]\n- **主持人**: [Name]\n- **讨论嘉宾**: [Panelist names and titles, separated by commas for multiple panelists]\n\n---\n\n## 快速摘要\n\n> [用3–5句话概括本次讨论的核心内容与主要结论，便于快速了解。]\n\n---\n\n## 背景\n\n[简要介绍本次讨论的背景、目的与议题设定，说明其意义或所处的行业/社会语境。]\n\n---\n\n## 主要话题与亮点\n\n### 话题 1: [Topic name]\n\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n\n### 话题 2: [Topic name]\n\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n\n### 话题 3: [Topic name]\n\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n- [Point]\n\n> 如有更多话题，请按相同结构补充。\n\n---\n\n## 嘉宾核心观点\n\n### [Panelist name]\n\n- **核心立场**: [This panelist's main viewpoint or position]\n- **关键论据**: [Main supporting evidence or cases for their viewpoint]\n- **代表性引述**: [Direct quote or key line]\n\n### [Panelist name]\n\n- **核心立场**: [This panelist's main viewpoint or position]\n- **关键论据**: [Main supporting evidence or cases for their viewpoint]\n- **代表性引述**: [Direct quote or key line]\n\n### [Panelist name]\n\n- **核心立场**: [This panelist's main viewpoint or position]\n- **关键论据**: [Main supporting evidence or cases for their viewpoint]\n- **代表性引述**: [Direct quote or key line]\n\n---\n\n## 争议与共识\n\n| 话题 | 分歧点 | 共识点 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| [Topic] | [Main disagreement] | [Agreed-upon content] |\n| [Topic] | [Main disagreement] | [Agreed-upon content] |\n\n---\n\n## 结论与收获\n\n- [Conclusion or takeaway]\n- [Conclusion or takeaway]\n- [Conclusion or takeaway]\n\n---\n\n## 后续跟进\n\n- [ ] [Follow-up item or action item]\n- [ ] [Follow-up item or action item]\n- [ ] [Follow-up item or action item]";
"template_prompt.case_record" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 病例记录\n\n## 基本信息\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| 就诊日期 | [Visit date] |\n| 患者姓名 | [Patient name] |\n| 性别 | [Gender] |\n| 年龄 | [Age] |\n| 科室 | [Department] |\n| 主治医师 | [Attending physician] |\n| 病历号 | [Medical record number] |\n\n---\n\n## 主观资料\n\n### 主诉\n[The patient's main symptom(s) and duration]\n\n### 现病史\n[Onset and progression of symptoms, accompanying symptoms, triggers, and aggravating or relieving factors]\n\n### 既往史\n[Past illnesses, surgeries, injuries, and hospitalizations]\n\n### 用药史\n[Current and recent medication use, including drug names, dosages, and duration]\n\n### 过敏史\n[Drug, food, or other substance allergies]\n\n### 家族史\n[Family history relevant to this visit]\n\n---\n\n## 客观资料\n\n### 生命体征\n\n| 项目 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 体温 | [Temperature] |\n| 脉搏 | [Pulse] |\n| 呼吸频率 | [Respiratory rate] |\n| 血压 | [Blood pressure] |\n| 血氧饱和度 | [Oxygen saturation] |\n| 身高 / 体重 | [Height] / [Weight] |\n\n### 体格检查\n[Positive and relevant negative findings across body systems]\n\n### 辅助检查\n[Summary of laboratory results, imaging results, and other diagnostic test findings]\n\n---\n\n## 评估\n\n### 初步诊断\n[Diagnosis or differential diagnosis based on subjective and objective findings]\n\n### 诊断依据\n[Key subjective and objective evidence supporting the above diagnosis]\n\n### 鉴别诊断\n[Other possible diagnoses to rule out, and the key distinguishing factors]\n\n---\n\n## 处置计划\n\n### 进一步检查\n[Additional tests to be completed and their purpose]\n\n### 治疗方案\n[Specific plan, e.g., medication, surgery, physical therapy]\n\n### 医嘱与注意事项\n[Diet, activity, lifestyle adjustments, and special precautions]\n\n### 随访安排\n[Follow-up visit timing, cycle, and monitoring indicators]\n\n---\n\n## 补充说明\n[其他值得记录的信息，如患者依从性或关键沟通要点]";
"template_prompt.psychotherapy_session_record" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 心理治疗会谈记录\n\n## 基本信息\n- **来访者编号**: [Client ID]\n- **治疗师**: [Therapist name]\n- **会谈日期**: [Date]\n- **会谈时长**: [Duration]\n- **会谈次数**: 第 [Number] 次\n- **会谈形式**: [Individual / Group / Family / Online]\n\n---\n\n## 主诉与当前状况\n[The client's core concerns, main issues, and current life situation raised in this session]\n\n---\n\n## 情绪与心理状态评估\n- **情绪状态**: [描述来访者在本次会谈中呈现的整体情绪基调，如焦虑、低落、平稳等]\n- **认知状态**: [描述思维连贯性、注意力、现实感等]\n- **行为表现**: [描述会谈中的行为反应，如回避、配合、防御等]\n- **风险评估**: [是否存在自伤、自杀或伤害他人的风险；如无可写 \"未发现风险\"]\n\n---\n\n## 会谈内容摘要\n[Structured summary of the main content of this session, including key events, emotional experiences, and cognitive patterns shared by the client]\n\n---\n\n## 关键信息与主题\n- [Theme 1]\n- [Theme 2]\n- [Theme 3]\n\n---\n\n## 治疗干预\n- **使用技术**: [e.g., cognitive restructuring, exposure therapy, empty chair technique, mindfulness exercises]\n- **干预过程**: [描述治疗师在本次会谈中的主要干预策略及来访者的回应]\n- **来访者反应**: [The client's emotional and cognitive response to the intervention]\n\n---\n\n## 与既往史及背景的关联\n[Analysis of how this session's content relates to past history, childhood experiences, significant relationships, or prior trauma]\n\n---\n\n## 治疗进展评估\n- **治疗目标进展**: [Current progress relative to the established treatment goals]\n- **变化与突破**: [Signs of growth or shifts in the client's thinking observed in this session]\n- **阻抗与挑战**: [Resistance encountered in treatment or issues yet to be resolved]\n\n---\n\n## 下一步治疗安排\n- **下次会谈重点**: [Topics planned to be prioritized in the next session]\n- **布置的练习**: [布置给来访者的练习或观察任务；如无可写 \"暂无\"]\n- **治疗调整建议**: [Whether adjustments to session frequency, direction, or other interventions are needed]\n\n---\n\n## 治疗师笔记\n[The therapist's personal observations, awareness of countertransference, or items requiring further supervision from this session]";
"template_prompt.medical_consultation" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 就诊咨询总结\n\n## 基本信息\n- **就诊日期**: [Date]\n- **就诊类型**: [Outpatient / Consultation / Follow-up / Return visit]\n- **科室 / 专科**: [Department name]\n- **主治医师**: [Physician name and title]\n- **患者信息**: [Basic characteristics such as age, gender]\n\n---\n\n## 主诉与现病史\n[Description of the patient's main symptoms for this visit, including onset time, duration, progression, and accompanying symptoms]\n\n---\n\n## 既往史与当前用药\n- **既往疾病**: [Previously diagnosed conditions or surgical history]\n- **过敏史**: [Drug or other allergies]\n- **当前用药**: [Names, dosages, and duration of medications currently being taken]\n\n---\n\n## 本次检查与评估\n- **体格检查**: [Key findings and abnormalities]\n- **辅助检查**: [Summary of relevant lab, imaging, or other test results]\n- **医生评估**: [The physician's overall judgment and analysis of the condition]\n\n---\n\n## 诊断\n- **初步诊断 / 确诊诊断**: [Diagnosis name]\n- **诊断依据**: [Key information supporting the diagnosis]\n- **鉴别诊断**: [Other possible diagnoses ruled out or pending]\n\n---\n\n## 治疗方案\n- **药物治疗**: [Prescribed drug names, dosages, usage, and duration]\n- **非药物治疗**: [Surgery, physical therapy, lifestyle interventions, etc.]\n- **注意事项**: [Medication contraindications, dietary restrictions, activity recommendations, etc.]\n\n---\n\n## 患者提问与医生解答\n| 患者提问 | 医生解答 |\n|----------|----------|\n| [Question 1] | [Answer 1] |\n| [Question 2] | [Answer 2] |\n\n---\n\n## 随访\n- **复诊安排**: [Follow-up visit time and purpose]\n- **待完成检查**: [Tests or exams still to be completed]\n- **监测要点**: [Symptoms or indicators requiring close attention]\n- **紧急情况指引**: [What situations require immediate medical attention or contact with the physician]\n\n---\n\n## 就诊备注\n[其他值得记录的补充信息，如多学科会诊意见或与家属的沟通情况]";
"template_prompt.bant_customer_analysis" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# BANT 客户分析报告\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **客户公司**: [Customer company name]\n- **联系人**: [Name and title]\n- **沟通日期**: [Date]\n- **沟通渠道**: [In person / Phone / Video call]\n- **销售负责人**: [Name]\n\n---\n\n## 预算（Budget）\n\n> 评估客户对本次采购的投入意愿与能力\n\n- **预算范围**: [Specific amount or range]\n- **预算状态**: [Confirmed / Pending approval / Not yet defined]\n- **预算周期**: [Current fiscal year / Next fiscal year / No constraint]\n- **补充说明**: [Customer's attitude toward budget, constraints, or flexibility]\n\n---\n\n## 决策权（Authority）\n\n> 分析本次采购决策的关键人物及其影响力\n\n- **最终决策人**: [Name and title]\n- **参与评估者**: [Name and title]\n- **决策流程**: [Individual decision / Committee approval / Requires upper-management sign-off]\n- **关键影响者**: [People with significant influence on the decision, and their stance]\n- **补充说明**: [Level of leadership attention or internal resistance to this purchase]\n\n---\n\n## 需求（Need）\n\n> 客户的核心问题与对解决方案的期待\n\n- **核心痛点**: [The main problem the customer explicitly stated]\n- **业务目标**: [What the customer hopes to achieve through this purchase]\n- **现有方案**: [Product or approach currently in use]\n- **不满与差距**: [What the current solution fails to address]\n- **优先关注**: [The feature or value the customer cares about most]\n- **补充说明**: [Implicit needs or unstated expectations]\n\n---\n\n## 时间线（Timeline）\n\n> 客户的采购节奏与关键节点\n\n- **预计决策日期**: [Specific date or range]\n- **预计上线日期**: [Specific date or range]\n- **紧迫程度**: [Very urgent / Planned / No clear timeline]\n- **关键节点**: [Important events or deadlines affecting the purchase process]\n- **补充说明**: [可能导致延期的因素]\n\n---\n\n## 商机评估\n\n- **整体评级**: [High / Medium / Low]\n- **赢单概率**: [Estimated percentage]\n- **关键优势**: [Our core competitive advantages in this opportunity]\n- **潜在风险**: [Uncertain factors that could affect closing the deal]\n\n---\n\n## 下一步计划\n\n| 行动项 | 负责人 | 截止日期 |\n|--------|------|--------|\n| [Action item 1] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item 2] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Action item 3] | [Owner] | [Date] |";
"template_prompt.sales_call_customer_outreach" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 销售通话记录\n\n## 基本信息\n- **日期**: [Date]\n- **客户姓名 / 公司**: [Customer name or company]\n- **销售代表**: [Sales rep name]\n- **渠道**: [Channel, e.g. phone / in-person / video call]\n- **通话时长**: [Duration]\n\n---\n\n## 客户背景\n[简述客户的行业背景、当前业务状况或整体情况]\n\n---\n\n## 客户需求\n### 核心需求\n[The customer's clearly stated core need or main problem to solve]\n\n### 潜在需求\n[Deeper needs, pain points, or future expectations implied or inferred from the conversation]\n\n---\n\n## 讨论的产品 / 服务\n| 产品 / 服务 | 讨论要点 | 客户反应 |\n|:-----------:|:------:|:------:|\n| [Product name] | [Key points] | [Positive / Neutral / Concerned] |\n| [Product name] | [Key points] | [Positive / Neutral / Concerned] |\n\n---\n\n## 潜在解决方案\n[结合客户需求，概述本次通话中提出或探讨的解决方向]\n\n---\n\n## 客户顾虑与异议\n- [Concern 1]\n- [Concern 2]\n- [Concern 3]\n\n---\n\n## 关键共识\n[双方在本次通话中达成的共识、一致意见或初步意向]\n\n---\n\n## 后续跟进\n| 事项 | 负责人 | 预期日期 |\n|:---:|:----:|:------:|\n| [Follow-up item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n| [Follow-up item] | [Owner] | [Date] |\n\n---\n\n## 整体评估\n- **购买意向**: [High / Medium / Low]\n- **预期阶段**: [Stage, e.g. initial contact / solution discussion / quoting / contract preparation]\n- **备注**: [Other information worth recording]";
"template_prompt.sales_discovery_call" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 销售探索通话总结\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **通话日期**: [Date]\n- **通话时长**: [Duration]\n- **销售代表**: [Name / Title]\n- **客户联系人**: [Name / Title]\n- **公司**: [Company name]\n- **通话目的**: [Core goal of this call]\n\n---\n\n## 客户画像\n\n- **行业**: [Industry]\n- **公司规模**: [Number of employees / Revenue scale]\n- **主营业务**: [Brief description of main business]\n- **决策角色**: [Contact's role in the purchase decision, e.g. decision maker / influencer / executor]\n- **其他背景**: [Other information useful for assessing lead quality]\n\n---\n\n## 需求与痛点\n\n- **明确需求**: [Needs the customer raised proactively during the call]\n- **潜在痛点**: [Implicit problems or business challenges inferred from the conversation]\n- **现有方案**: [Product, solution, or vendor the customer currently uses]\n- **对现有方案的不满**: [Pain points or switching-intent signals shared by the customer]\n\n---\n\n## 商机评估\n\n- **意向程度**: [High / Medium / Low]\n- **预算状况**: [Clear budget / Vague budget / No budget yet]\n- **采购时间线**: [Expected decision or purchase cycle]\n- **竞争格局**: [Whether comparing other vendors, and which competitors]\n- **商机小结**: [Overall assessment of this call's opportunity value and priority]\n\n---\n\n## 关键讨论点\n\n- [Key question or concern raised by the customer]\n- [Sales rep's core response or value proposition delivered]\n- [Consensus or preliminary intent reached by both parties]\n\n---\n\n## 客户异议及应对\n\n| 异议 | 回应 | 结果 |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| [Objection 1] | [Response] | [Resolved / Pending follow-up / Unresolved] |\n| [Objection 2] | [Response] | [Resolved / Pending follow-up / Unresolved] |\n\n---\n\n## 行动项\n\n- [ ] [Action item 1, with owner and deadline]\n- [ ] [Action item 2, with owner and deadline]\n- [ ] [Action item 3, with owner and deadline]\n\n---\n\n## 下次跟进计划\n\n- **计划跟进日期**: [Date]\n- **跟进方式**: [Phone / Email / Visit / Demo]\n- **跟进重点**: [Key points to advance or confirm in the next conversation]\n\n---\n\n## 通话小结\n\n[Overall assessment of this call, including customer attitude, effectiveness of the conversation, sales stage, and recommendations for next steps]";
"template_prompt.client_needs" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 客户需求分析总结\n\n## 基本信息\n- **客户名称**: [Client name]\n- **行业**: [Industry]\n- **公司规模**: [Company size]\n- **会面日期**: [Date]\n- **顾问**: [Consultant name]\n\n---\n\n## 客户背景\n[简述客户的业务背景、发展阶段与当前经营状况]\n\n---\n\n## 核心痛点\n> 客户目前面临的主要问题与挑战\n\n1. [Pain point 1]\n2. [Pain point 2]\n3. [Pain point 3]\n\n---\n\n## 需求与期望\n> 客户明确提出或隐含表达的要求与目标\n\n| 需求类型 | 具体说明 | 优先级 |\n|------|------|----|\n| [Need type] | [Specific description] | 高 / 中 / 低 |\n| [Need type] | [Specific description] | 高 / 中 / 低 |\n| [Need type] | [Specific description] | 高 / 中 / 低 |\n\n---\n\n## 可用资源与约束\n- **可用资源**: [Budget range, team setup, existing tools, etc.]\n- **约束条件**: [Timeline, policy limits, technical bottlenecks, etc.]\n\n---\n\n## 关键决策信息\n- **决策人**: [Name or role of the final decision maker]\n- **决策周期**: [Expected decision timeline]\n- **评估标准**: [The client's core considerations when choosing a solution]\n\n---\n\n## 竞争与参考情况\n[Competitors, benchmarks, or previously tried solutions the client mentioned, along with their evaluation]\n\n---\n\n## 顾问洞察\n> 基于本次沟通的整体判断\n\n- **需求真实性**: [Assessment of how well the stated need matches the actual need]\n- **合作意向**: [The client's willingness to partner and urgency level]\n- **潜在风险**: [Risk factors that could affect moving forward]\n\n---\n\n## 后续计划\n- [ ] [Action item 1] - 负责人: [Name] - 截止日期: [Date]\n- [ ] [Action item 2] - 负责人: [Name] - 截止日期: [Date]\n- [ ] [Action item 3] - 负责人: [Name] - 截止日期: [Date]";
"template_prompt.discussion_with_expert" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 专家座谈纪要\n\n## 基本信息\n- **座谈主题**: [Topic]\n- **座谈日期**: [Date]\n- **出席专家**: [Expert names and affiliations]\n- **主持人**: [Name]\n- **纪要整理**: 由 AI 自动生成\n\n---\n\n## 话题概述\n[简述本次讨论的核心话题、背景与主要目的，2-4句话]\n\n---\n\n## 核心观点\n\n### [Expert name]\n- **主要立场**: [This expert's core argument or perspective]\n- **要点**:\n  - [Point 1]\n  - [Point 2]\n  - [Point 3]\n- **直接引述**:\n  > \"[Representative quote]\"\n\n### [Expert name]\n- **主要立场**: [This expert's core argument or perspective]\n- **要点**:\n  - [Point 1]\n  - [Point 2]\n  - [Point 3]\n- **直接引述**:\n  > \"[Representative quote]\"\n\n---\n\n## 争论与分歧\n| 焦点话题 | 各方立场 | 关键分歧 |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| [Topic] | [Expert A's view] vs [Expert B's view] | [Description of core disagreement] |\n| [Topic] | [Expert A's view] vs [Expert B's view] | [Description of core disagreement] |\n\n---\n\n## 共识与结论\n- [本次讨论达成的共识或结论 1]\n- [本次讨论达成的共识或结论 2]\n- [本次讨论达成的共识或结论 3]\n\n---\n\n## 精彩语录\n> \"[Noteworthy detailed statement or professional remark]\"\n> —— [Expert name]\n\n> \"[Noteworthy detailed statement or professional remark]\"\n> —— [Expert name]\n\n---\n\n## 待进一步讨论的问题\n- [Issue 1 not fully discussed or in dispute, needing follow-up]\n- [Issue 2 not fully discussed or in dispute, needing follow-up]\n\n---\n\n## 下一步安排\n| 行动项 | 负责人 | 预期日期 |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| [Item description] | [Name] | [Date] |\n| [Item description] | [Name] | [Date] |";
"template_prompt.senior_management_consultant" = "请根据转录内容填写本报告。将每个 [bracketed] 占位符替换为从转录中提取的真实内容，删去没有任何内容可填的章节，绝不要在输出中保留占位符。严格保持各标题及顺序与原文一致。仅以 Markdown 格式回复填写完成的报告，不要输出其他任何内容。\n\n# 管理咨询总结\n\n## 基本信息\n- **咨询日期**: [Date]\n- **咨询主题**: [Topic]\n- **客户/公司**: [Client name]\n- **参与人员**: [Participants]\n- **咨询顾问**: [Consultant name]\n\n---\n\n## 背景与议题\n[简述本次咨询的业务背景、核心议题与客户诉求，2-4句话]\n\n---\n\n## 问题诊断\n\n### 核心问题\n- [Core issue 1]\n- [Core issue 2]\n- [Core issue 3]\n\n### 根因分析\n- [Root cause 1]\n- [Root cause 2]\n\n---\n\n## 战略建议\n\n### 短期举措（0-3 个月）\n- [Short-term recommendation 1]\n- [Short-term recommendation 2]\n\n### 中期规划（3-12 个月）\n- [Mid-term recommendation 1]\n- [Mid-term recommendation 2]\n\n### 长期方向（1 年以上）\n- [Long-term strategic direction]\n\n---\n\n## 关键洞察\n> [The consultant's most important judgment or industry insight from this consultation, 1-3 items]\n\n- [Insight 1]\n- [Insight 2]\n- [Insight 3]\n\n---\n\n## 风险提示\n| 风险事项 | 风险等级 | 建议应对 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| [Risk 1] | [High/Medium/Low] | [Response measure] |\n| [Risk 2] | [High/Medium/Low] | [Response measure] |\n\n---\n\n## 行动计划\n| 行动项 | 负责人 | 截止日期 | 优先级 |\n|----------|--------|----------|--------|\n| [Action 1] | [Owner] | [Deadline] | [High/Medium/Low] |\n| [Action 2] | [Owner] | [Deadline] | [High/Medium/Low] |\n| [Action 3] | [Owner] | [Deadline] | [High/Medium/Low] |\n\n---\n\n## 后续跟进\n- **下次咨询日期**: [Date]\n- **待确认事项**: [Content pending confirmation]\n- **客户承诺**: [Client's committed actions]\n\n---\n\n## 顾问备注\n[Consultant's additional notes on this consultation, unresolved items, or special reminders]";
